                                "sense_id": "21c313e6-525e-38b9-ae22-e6dc9293f292",
                                "text": "And how was she to know that one may live in London, or New York, a village in Yorkshire, or a dorp in the backveld […] but one behaves inevitably, inexorably, exactly like everyone else."
